              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "لومڑی (lomṛī) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from lompaṭa, \"fox\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 11153). It is a variant CDIAL reconstructs beside Sanskrit lomaṭaka, \"fox\"; CDIAL suggests these forms may blend a word for \"fox\" with words for \"hair\" and \"tail\"."
